      "Generates portfolio analysis that separates quick wins, big bets, fill-ins, and time sinks.",
      "Creates suggested quarterly roadmaps from prioritized features and team capacity.",
      "Extracts pain points, feature requests, jobs-to-be-done, sentiment, themes, metrics, and competitors from interview transcripts.",
